{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"532f4cf4448a8067dcc56491485eb61a04d9f3caa906cbd0f7c373c039bd8cbc","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"3977a0fcaaccd9b500bf707632a311f53acea58c0c790677acf45bba67660bb6","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3fbeca0974583c843d096fff5ed1ea65bd55949400e471eb30a6a72f5bf70c36","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"misc.lua:499 (commit 624a6732) says 'Kezrak and Moltep, or stone and forest trolls as they are colloquially known'. The 'as' here means 'which is how they are colloquially known': stone troll and forest troll are the everyday names for Kezrak and Moltep. The translation, '或者说岩石和森林巨魔，因为这更加通俗地为人所知', turns it into a causal 'because this is more commonly known', which is a semantic error. It should read like '即俗称的岩石巨魔和森林巨魔'. Also in the same entry: 'a thick, solid hide which bears the appearance of coal or granite' became '厚厚的煤黑色或花岗岩状的外观', which drops the subject 'hide'."},{"revision_key":"43bb145b7a2c09c6aab82558ffd8723d9509c9c8a6825988ea190c09f05a38b2","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"48484bd69e8dc02dd5a93458860703c6a93ac9571142f5d3c4bf177e2a4f22c2","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4b3491d1633ae0f4195e34de775888e1b5d58b1819e11ed51f9e9347bbc86617","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"66376abb91852d2fd95852a5270035cb24f4c40c010587a2fca22637c6c5a8d9","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"71970bfdd55272a285b994eea42dfc31e60038b40a51aa298966b194e756c5cf","verdict":"OK"}]}